# NovaCore

NovaCore is the hearth of our tech startup. It's the compute module that will power our entire project.

NovaCore will be equiped with custom DDR4/5 Lanes, And is packed with a RK3588 Rockchip chip, We have decided to pick this
chip for our V0.1 version, It's a quality chip and has everything that we need to get started.

# Structure

This repo has a proper file and folder structure, We want to keep everything as clear as possible for our team.

Strucutre --> Docs

- Overview
- Measurments
- Electrical General IO Layout
- PPL
- PCIe2/SATA Interface
- DDR PLL
- ...